{"s": {"beats": [], "code": "cam = thing(\"video_camera\", x=-3.5, h=3.0, color=TEAL)\nenter(cam, \"left\")\ncamera(zoom=1.25, to=(-3.5, 0.2))\nsfx(\"pop\")\n\nwhen(\"tiny 2% cut\")\ncamera(zoom=1.0, to=(-1.8, 0.2))\npts = thing(\"trophy\", x=0.0, h=2.8, color=GOLD)\nenter(pts, \"grow\")\ncut_txt = text(\"2%\", x=0.0, y=2.3, style=\"number\", color=GREEN)\nadd(cut_txt)\n\nwhen(\"millions straight into their bank account\")\nmove(cam, to=(-8.5, 2.0), dur=0.45)\ncamera(zoom=1.0, to=(1.5, 0.3))\nb = thing(\"bank\", x=3.0, h=3.5, color=BLUE)\nenter(b, \"pop\")\nflow(pts, b, item=\"gold_bar\", n=8)\npile(\"coin\", n=8, x=3.0, size=0.55)\nmil = text(\"$0M\", x=3.0, y=2.5, style=\"number\", color=GOLD)\nadd(mil)\ncount(mil, to=10, frm=0, prefix=\"$\", suffix=\"M\", dur=1.0)\n", "duration": 12.3, "narration": "Compare that to a movie star who negotiates backend points, where a tiny 2% cut of box office tickets sends millions straight into their bank account. Video game contracts rarely share the upside like that.", "objects": [{"id": "n0", "obj": "video_camera"}, {"id": "n1", "obj": "trophy"}, {"id": "n2", "obj": "bank"}, {"id": "n3", "obj": "gold_bar"}, {"id": "n4", "obj": "coin"}], "theme": "visual", "words": [["Compare", 0.0], ["that", 0.42], ["to", 0.64], ["a", 0.8], ["movie", 0.9], ["star", 1.16], ["who", 1.48], ["negotiates", 1.74], ["backend", 2.32], ["points,", 2.62], ["where", 3.4], ["a", 3.58], ["tiny", 3.7], ["2%", 3.96], ["cut", 4.48], ["of", 4.64], ["box", 4.86], ["office", 5.1], ["tickets", 5.36], ["sends", 5.7], ["millions", 6.0], ["straight", 6.32], ["into", 6.7], ["their", 6.98], ["bank", 7.26], ["account.", 7.4], ["Video", 8.44], ["game", 8.62], ["contracts", 8.94], ["rarely", 9.42], ["share", 9.78], ["the", 10.08], ["upside", 10.24], ["like", 10.58], ["that.", 10.88]]}, "script": 1, "v": true}